{
  "id": "DAN.2",
  "number": "2",
  "bookId": "DAN",
  "reference": "Dan 2",
  "verseCount": 46,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "2",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "DAN 2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "2",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Daneeri naasoborra amakuru g'ekirooto kya Nebbukadeneeza",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu mwaka ogwa kabiri ogw'okulema kwa Nebbukadaneeza, Nebbukadaneeza akaroota ebirooto, omwoyo gwamusarra, n'oturo twamuhwaho n'okugwijagira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nubwo omukama yaragiire beete: abakozi b'amasano, abaraguzi, abarogo, n'Abakaludaaya, baije basoborre amakuru ag'ebirooto by'omukama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obu baizire baayemerra omumaiso ge, yabagambira ati ndaire ndoosire ekirooto omutima gwansarra omunda ninyenda kumanya amakuru g'ekirooto eki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nubwo Abakaludaaya baamugambira bati: “Hangiriza agutamba, ebiro byona! Tugambire eky'oroosire, tukusoborre amakuru gakyo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama yabagarukamu ati: “Kakuba mulemwa kummanyisa ekirooto mukansoborra n'amakuru gaakyo, ninyija kubataagataagura n'amaju gaanyu ngaseese. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu obu murammanyisa ekirooto mukansoborra n'amakuru gaakyo nyowe ndaabahaga ebisembo bingi, empeera n'ekitiinisa. Hati nu mungambire ekirooto n'amakuru gaakyo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baamugarukamu obwakabiri bati “Agutamba, tugambire eki oroosire, tukusoborre amakuru gaakyo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama yagarukamu ati: ningumya nimwenda kutunga omwanya, habwokuba mwetegeriize ekigambo kyange nkooku kiri ky'amazima: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nkooku ngambire nti obu muraalemwa kummanyisa ekirooto eki, ninyija kubaha ekifubiro kimu mwikirranize kungambira ebisuba nukwo akasumi kahingule. Habweki, mummanyise ekirooto, nubwo ndaagumya nti muransoborra kwo amakuru gaakyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abakaludaaya baagarukamu omukama bati: Agutamba, busaho muntu omunsi yoona asobora kukukorra eky'orukwenda; habwokuba, tihakabahoga mukama ow'ekitiinisa kandi ow'obusobozi, arakagwize omukozi w'amasano, omufumu, rundi Omukaludaaya ekintu nk'eki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekintu eky'orukukaguza, kigumire muno, tiharoho muntu n'omu asobora kukikugarukamu okwihaho embandwa ezitaikara n'abantu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama obu yahuliire eki, yakwatwa ekiniga, nukwo kuragira ati: Abantu ab'amagezi aba Babbulooni boona, babaite; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nukwo kuturukya ekiragiro ekirukugamba kiti abantu ab'amagezi boona baitwe, Daneeri n'abanywani be batabuziremu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nubwo Daneeri yagarukiremu Alyoki, engabwa y'ihe eryalindaga omukama, ow'akaba atumirwe kwita abantu ab'amagezi aba Babbulooni, mpora n'obwegendereza ati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Wewe ngamba y'omukama, kiki ekyaturukisize omukama ekiragiro eky'ekiniga ekirukwingana aho?” Alyoki yasoborra Daneeri ekyabaireho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daneeri yagenda mb'omukama yamwesengereza muno, amuhe akasumi, nukwo amusoborre amakuru ag'ekirooto eki yaroosire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanyuma Daneeri yataaha omuka ye, eki yakimanyisa bagenzi be Hananiya, Misaheeri, n'Azaliya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yabagambira ati: Mwesengereze Ruhanga ow'omwiguru abagirre embabazi, kandi bamusabe abasoborre ensita egi, nukwo Daneeri baleke kwitwa n'abantu abandi ab'amagezi aba Babbulooni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu bwire bw'ekiro eki kyonyini ensita egi yayolekwa Daneeri, Daneeri nukwo kuhaisaniza Ruhanga ow'omwiguru ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "naagamba ati:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nubwo Alyoki yahikize bwango Daneeri omumaiso g'omukama yamugambira ati: “Omu bantu enzaahisibwa abaarugire mboinemu omuntu arukusobora kukusoborra amakuru ag'ekirooto eki waroosire.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama nubwo yakagwize Daneeri, kandi ayayetwaga n'erya Beriteesaza ati: ngu weza, osobora kummanyisa ekirooto eki naroosire, okansoborra n'amakuru gaakyo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daneeri yagarukamu omukama ati: “Busaho bantu abanyamagezi busaho bafumu, busaho abakozi b'amasano rundi abaraguzi rundi abecumitiriza eby'enyunyuuzi abasobora kumanyisa omukama ensita egi ei yakagwize, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "baitu haroho Ruhanga ow'omwiguru, anyakusuukura ensita, kandi nuwe amanyisize omukama Nebbukadaneeza ebiribaho omu biro eby'omumaiso. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ganu nugo amakuru ag'ekirooto waroosire, n'omutwe gwawe ebi gwakwolekere, obyamire omu kitabu kyawe, okaroota eby'omumaiso, kandi Ruhanga anyakusukurra ensita, nuwe akumanyisize ebirukwija kubaho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu nyowe nkasuukulirwa ensita enu, tihali habw'okuba n'amagezi agarukukira ag'abantu boona, baitu nukwo nsobole kukusoborra, omanye ebiteekerezo eby'omutima gwawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mwebingwa, omu kwolekwa kwawe, okarora ekisisani ekikooto muno ekirukwengeengeta kandi ekirukumasamasa, omuntu eki akaba atarukusobora kugumyaho eriiso. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omutwe gwakyo gukaba guli gwa zaabbu enungi, ekifuba n'emikono yakyo ekozirwe omu feeza enungi, n'emikono yakyo ekozirwe omu feeza, enda n'ebibero bikozirwe omu mulinga, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "amaguru gaakyo gakaba gali g'ekyoma, ebigere byakyo, ekicweka ekimu ky'ekyoma, ekicweka ekindi ky'ibumba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obu wabaga okihangire amaiso hakaija ibaale erikooto lyacweka ha mwandara, hataroho muntu alikwasireho, lyateera ebigere byakyo ebyakozirwe ekicweka ky'ekyoma, ekicweka ky'ibumba lyabisaasangura; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nubwo ekyoma, ibumba, omulinga, efeeza, na zaabbu, byaasasangukiire kimu, byaasisana nk'omusunga ogwa ha mbuga ezihulirwaho omu kasumi k'ekyanda omuyaga gwabihuuhuura gwabitwara hara muno, kigumu kumanya nambere omuyaga gwabitomeseze. Baitu ibaale eryatiire ekisisani kiri, likafooka rusozi orukooto, orurukumaraho ensi yoona.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ekirooto nikyo eki; hati ka nkusoborre amakuru gaakyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iwe omukama, omukama w'abakama, Ruhanga ow'omwiguru ou yahaire obukama, obusobozi, amaani, n'ekitiinisa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ou yakwasize abaana b'abantu ebisoro eby'omu kisaka n'enyonyi ez'omu mwanya, yakufoora mulemi w'ebi byona, hoona nambere bikaikara-niiwe mutwe ogwa zaabbu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iwe obw olirugaho, haliimuka obukama obundi, obutarukwingana n'obwawe ekitiinisa, kandi haliimuka obukama obwa kasatu obw'omulinga, obu nubwo bulirema ensi yoona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi halibaho obukama obwa kana obw'amaani nk'ekyoma, habwokuba ekyoma nikyo kisaasangura kandi kibberengura ebintu byona; kandi nk'ekyoma oku kibberengura, obukama obu nabwo bulibberengura kandi busaasangule amakama agandi agalibwebembera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkooku waboine ebigere n'ebyara byabyo ekicweka ky'ibumba, ekicweka ky'ekyoma, eki nikimanyisa obukama obu bulibaganizibwamu; baitu bulikiraho amaani nk'ag'ekyoma, habwokuba, ekyoma kikajwanganizibwa omu ibumba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebyaara ekicweka kuba ky'ekyoma, ekicweka kuba ky'ibumba eki nikimanyisa obukama obu buliba bw'amaani kandi buliba buceke. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi okabona ekyoma kitabwirwemu ibumba. Eki nikimanyisa: abalemi ab'obukama obu, balirengaho okuteeraniza enganda zaabo nibaswerrana baitu tibalisobora, nkooku ekyoma kitasobora kutaburwa n'ibumba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu bulemi bw'abakama abo, Ruhanga ow'omwiguru aliimukya obukama obw'okwikaraho ebiro byona kandi obusobozi bwabwo tibuliheebwa ihanga erindi. Obukama obu bulisaasangura amakama agandi goona bugahwerekereze, kandi buliikaraho ebiro byona; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nkooku warozire ibaale eryatemerwe ha rusozi hataroho muntu alitemere, nkooku lyasaasangwire ekisisani ekyakozirwe omu kyoma, omu mulinga, omu ibumba, omu feeza n'omu zaabbu; Ruhanga ow'ekitiinisa akumanyisize ebiribaho omu biro eby'omumaiso. Ekirooto waroosire ky'amazima, kandi amakuru gaakyo tigali g'okuguragurukya.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.45"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama Nebbukadaneeza ajuumaire omumaiso ga Daneeri, yaragira bamuhongere ekihongwa bamucumikirre n'obubbani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama yagambira Daneeri ati: “Mazima kwo, Ruhanga wawe nuwe Ruhanga w'abaruhanga kandi nuwe MUKAMA w'abakama, kandi nuwe asukurra ensita, kinu nkimanyisiibwe, iwe habw'okusobora kusoborra ensita enu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanyuma yamuha ekiikaro eky'ekitiinisa n'ebisembo ebirungi bingi, yamufoora mulemi w'isaza lyona erya Babbulooni, yamufoora mukuru arukurolerra abantu abanyamagezi boona aba Babbulooni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 2:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daneeri akasaba omukama, omukama yakoma Saduraaka, Mesaaka, n'Abedeneego, nubo babe n'omulimo ogw'okurolerra, ebintu ebirukufa hali Babbulooni, baitu uwe yasigara omu kikaali ky'omukama.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.2.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.2.49"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
